宁遂将家属浮海还郡。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f","yuanzhang-q2-5c55926811b00d1b1965"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-f05720ed8cdd6f8d807a","label":"正文","text":"管宁遂将家属浮海还郡，公孙恭送之南郊，加赠服物","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-d001cc765ba4361532f4"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-cd528625fafc567b5709","label":"正文","text":"管宁受而藏度、康、恭前后所资遗，既已西渡尽封还之","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-ea624a9e4f8c6e81ea55"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-53cdf3b7767cba305c6d","label":"裴注·傅子","text":"公孙康死，嫡子不立而立弟恭；管宁曰废嫡立庶下有异心乱之所由起，乃将家属乘海即受征；宁在辽东积三十七年乃归","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-c38a0a660fd477f2c286","label":"裴注·傅子","text":"管宁归途海中遇暴风，船皆没唯宁乘船自若；夜风晦冥望见火光趋之得岛，岛无居人又无火烬，行人以为神光之祐；皇甫谧曰积善之应","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-093b09c6157e1c3a725a"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-d78817710eba2b2dc5e8","label":"正文","text":"黄初中诏公卿举独行君子，华歆举管宁，帝以安东征之","evidence":["zhonghua-q-56166747e6635aa4db2c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0340","role":"为司徒，荐管宁","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"即位征管宁","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f"]},{"person":"huanchen-p0600","role":"被荐被征；将家属浮海还郡；受而藏公孙度、康、恭前后所资遗，既已西渡，尽封还之；曰废嫡立庶下有异心乱之所由起也，乃将家属乘海即受征，在辽东积三十七年乃归；海中遇暴风船皆没唯其乘船自若，望火光趋之得岛，行人咸异以为神光之祐","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f","yuanzhang-q-d001cc765ba4361532f4","yuanzhang-q-ea624a9e4f8c6e81ea55","yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb","yuanzhang-q-093b09c6157e1c3a725a"]},{"person":"wendi-p0015","role":"送之南郊，加赠服物；康弟，懦弱，被立","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-d001cc765ba4361532f4","yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb"]},{"person":"wudi-p0247","role":"已死","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f","yuanzhang-q-d001cc765ba4361532f4","yuanzhang-q-ea624a9e4f8c6e81ea55","yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb","yuanzhang-q-093b09c6157e1c3a725a"]},"ordering_evidence":"yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f","source_order":[11,368,0],"order":2660},{"id":"yuanzhang-e-o195","title":"公孙渊果袭夺恭位，叛国家南连吴僭号称王；明帝使相国、宣文侯征灭之，辽东死者以万计，如宁所筹","accounts":[{"id":"yuanzhang-a-06e8860923952a07bf5e","label":"裴注·傅子","text":"公孙渊果袭夺恭位，叛国家南连吴僭号称王；明帝使相国、宣文侯征灭之，辽东死者以万计，如宁所筹","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-1d933edd3bee001456c4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0013","role":"果袭夺恭位，叛国家而南连吴，僭号称王","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-1d933edd3bee001456c4"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"使相国、宣文侯征灭公孙渊","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-1d933edd3bee001456c4"]},{"person":"wendi-p0015","role":"位被袭夺","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-1d933edd3bee001456c4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-1d933edd3bee001456c4"]},"ordering_evidence":"yuanzhang-q-1d933edd3bee001456c4","source_order":[11,450,85],"order":2667}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0015","name":"公孙恭","evidence":["wendi-q-o021","mingdi-q-o012","gongsuntao-q-3dfda7291a97e1e462c4","gongsuntao-q-ba0bf752c4b5829a22a4","gongsuntao-q-9b68f6a8b6bb8a667f33","gongsuntao-q-200604a12736d7f81441","gongsuntao-q-d61453d0e147dde83e10","yuanzhang-q-d001cc765ba4361532f4","yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb","yuanzhang-q-1d933edd3bee001456c4"],"facts":[{"id":"gongsuntao-f-review-bd228a97fba2e4d6b974","text":"病阴消为阉人，劣弱不能治国","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-d61453d0e147dde83e10"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wendi-m-o021-wendi-p0015","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-o021"]},{"id":"mingdi-m-o012-wendi-p0015","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["mingdi-q-o012"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-200604a12736d7f81441","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-891f0ff8208cf72305d3","layer":"original","quote":"太和二年，渊胁夺恭位","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":193,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-3dfda7291a97e1e462c4","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-32cde7e21d373e6d01d7","layer":"original","quote":"度死，子康嗣位，以永宁乡侯封弟恭。是岁，建安九年也","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-9b68f6a8b6bb8a667f33","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-d9c910b62671c4a10be3","layer":"original","quote":"文帝践阼，遣使即拜恭为车骑将军，假节，封平郭侯；追赠康大司马","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-b7fb424a7ae6dc0054e3","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-891f0ff8208cf72305d3","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即（位）拜渊扬烈将军、辽东太守","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":193,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":31,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-ba0bf752c4b5829a22a4","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-d9c910b62671c4a10be3","layer":"original","quote":"康死，子晃、渊等皆小，众立恭为辽东太守","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-d61453d0e147dde83e10","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-891f0ff8208cf72305d3","layer":"original","quote":"恭病阴消为阉人〖2〗，劣弱不能治国","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":193,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":2,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o012d-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c12480a98111a703af26","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，诏公卿近臣举良将〖21〗，各一人。十一月，司徒王朗薨。十二月，诸葛亮围陈仓；曹真遣将军费曜等拒之。﹝五﹞辽东太守公孙恭兄子渊，劫夺恭位；遂以渊领辽东太守。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o012","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c12480a98111a703af26","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，诏公卿近臣举良将〖21〗，各一人。十一月，司徒王朗薨。十二月，诸葛亮围陈仓；曹真遣将军费曜等拒之。﹝五﹞辽东太守公孙恭兄子渊，劫夺恭位；遂以渊领辽东太守。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-o021a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-67d03764fda251baa53b","layer":"original","quote":"（春）三月，加辽东太守公孙恭为车骑将军〖19〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":229,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o021","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-67d03764fda251baa53b","layer":"original","quote":"（春）三月，加辽东太守公孙恭为车骑将军〖19〗。初复五铢钱〖20〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":229,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-093b09c6157e1c3a725a","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-1157405894aaf96d21ad","layer":"pei","quote":"宁之归也，海中遇暴风；船皆没，唯宁乘船自若。时夜风晦冥，船人尽惑，莫知所泊。望见有火光，辄趋之，得岛。岛无居人，又无火烬；行人咸异焉，以为神光之祐也。皇甫谧曰：‘积善之应也","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":449,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4555308644cb020df99a","start":134,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-1d933edd3bee001456c4","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-1157405894aaf96d21ad","layer":"pei","quote":"其后渊果袭夺恭位，叛国家而南连吴，僭号称王；明帝使相国、宣文侯征灭之，辽东之死者以万计：如宁所筹","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":449,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4555308644cb020df99a","start":85,"end":133,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-ce968cc1eb7efd4702c2","layer":"original","quote":"黄初四年，诏公卿举独行君子〖4〗。司徒华歆荐宁，文帝即（位）征宁","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-1157405894aaf96d21ad","layer":"pei","quote":"是时，康又已死，嫡子不立而立弟恭；恭懦弱，而康孽子渊有俊才。宁曰：‘废嫡立庶，下有异心，乱之所由起也。’乃将家属乘海即受征。宁在辽东，积三十七年乃归","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":449,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4555308644cb020df99a","start":10,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-d001cc765ba4361532f4","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-ce968cc1eb7efd4702c2","layer":"original","quote":"遂将家属，浮海还郡〖5〗；公孙恭送之南郊〖6〗，加赠服物","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":33,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-ea624a9e4f8c6e81ea55","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-ce968cc1eb7efd4702c2","layer":"original","quote":"自宁之东也，度、康、恭前后所资遗，皆受而藏诸；既已西渡，尽封还之","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":65,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q2-5c55926811b00d1b1965","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-ce968cc1eb7efd4702c2","layer":"original","quote":"黄初四年，诏公卿举独行君子〖4〗。司徒华歆荐宁，文帝即（位）征宁。遂将家属，浮海还郡〖5〗；公孙恭送之南郊〖6〗，加赠服物〖7〗。自宁之东也，度、康、恭前后所资遗，皆受而藏诸；既已西渡，尽封还之。﹝一﹞诏以宁为太中大夫，固辞不受。﹝二﹞","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-56166747e6635aa4db2c","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-a9855a57d7396cfcab6d","layer":"original","quote":"黄初中，诏公卿举独行君子；歆举管宁，帝以安东征之。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
